      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spotsylvania_Courthouse%2C_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The courthouse building, finished in 1840 by craftsmen who helped build the University of Virginia, was repaired after war damage in 1870.",
